 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_1": "* Hehehe!\n[wait:5]Isn't this the Terror Gang?",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_2": "* Girls, [wait:5]hurry up and run while you still have the chance!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_3": "* Ahead, [wait:5]a[color:yellow][wave:2,30,20][sound:orchhit]great terror[color:reset][wave:0] awaits you!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_4": "* [name:koakuma],\n[wait:5]what are you up to this time?!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_5": "* Hehehe!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_6": "* I'm merely giving you a warning!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_7": "* I'm so scared that I can't even go back to the Scarlet Mansion!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_8": "* Wh... [wait:5]What the heck is that!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_9": "* Oh hey, little guy!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_10": "* You're afraid of this thing?",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_11": "* Wow! [wait:5]Amanojaku!\n[wait:5]You're not scared at all?",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_12": "* Why would I be scared?",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_13": "* What can she do?\n[wait:5]Jump up and bite your face?",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_14": "* Well... [wait:5]usually...",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_15": "* It makes whoever holds it unable to suppress their desire to kill?",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_16": "* We... [wait:10]we made it!?",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_17": "* Wow!! [wait:5]I can't believe you guys actually\ndealt with her!!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_18": "* You guys are heroes!!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_19": "* Don't have to take that 20-minute detour back to the Mansion anymore!!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_20": "* Yeah, yeah, [wait:5]I know I did a pretty good job, right...?",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_21": "* Uh, [wait:5]Seija...?",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_22": "* Actually, [wait:5]uh...",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_23": "* You didn't help out at all just now.",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_24": "* Not only that, [wait:5]your attacks actually made things worse.",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_25": "* If you had been kind to her from the start...",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_26": "* This battle wouldn't have happened at all.",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_27": "* Huh?\n[wait:5]Are you serious?",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_28": "* That thing is a bloodthirsty monster!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_29": "* The kind you can't stop without giving her a good beating!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_30": "* Also, [wait:5]earlier, you scared those fairies...",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_31": "* Those fairies are enemies! [wait:5]They only exist to be scared!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_32": "* Yeah! [wait:5]She's right!!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_33": "* And before that, [wait:5]you ate a person's Moonlight Grass Onigiri...",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_34": "* Onigiri... [wait:10]are my enemies, too.",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_35": "* ...",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_36": "* Seija... [wait:10]whether you like it or not...",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_37": "* You are a hero.",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_38": "* A hero capable of creating a peaceful future.",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_39": "* Can you at least act... [wait:10]like a hero?",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_40": "* Wow, when you put it that way...",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_41": "* I'm really a pretty pathetic hero, [wait:5]aren't I?",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_42": "* Alright, human.\n[wait:5]I get it.\n[wait:5]I'll change myself.",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_43": "* From now on, [wait:5]I'll be a hero like a goody two-shoes...",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_44": "* ...Just kidding!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_45": "* I'm an Amanojaku! [wait:5]Do you really think I'd change?",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_46": "* Then you're dead wrong!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_47": "* Since you want me to be a hero, [wait:5]I'll just be a villain instead!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_48": "* R-Really!?",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_49": "* You want to team up with me?",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_50": "* Yeah, [wait:5]to be honest,\n[wait:5]this is exactly where I belong.",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_51": "* Seija, you...",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_52": "* Shut up, creepy woman! [wait:5]Seija is my partner now!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_53": "* Hahaha, [wait:5]that's right, creepy woman!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_54": "* We'll wear ties embroidered with both of our names!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_55": "* Right!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_56": "* Then we'll stay over at each other's houses!\n[wait:5]And share secrets!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_57": "* Mm, [wait:5]right?",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_58": "* Anyway, [wait:5]uh, guys,\n[wait:5]see you never.",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_59": "* Haha!! [wait:10]But first, [wait:5]you guys have to actually live that long!",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_60": "* Kogasa...",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_61": "* Maybe I shouldn't have been so strict with her just now.",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_62": "* After all, [wait:5]she is an Amanojaku...",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_63": "* But, [wait:5]I'm worried that if Seija is too eager to fight...",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_64": "* I'm afraid she might...",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_65": "* Anyway, [wait:5]let's just be good to her, [wait:5]okay, Kogasa?",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_cutscene_66": "* I'm sure Seija will be back very soon.",
 "world_rm_lake_bridge_chest_1": "* An empty chest.",

 "world_rm_girl_tree_check_1": "* It's an apple tree.",
 "world_rm_girl_tree_check_2": "* However, [wait:5]there isn't any apple on the tree.",
 "world_rm_girl_tree_behindtree": "* She is behind the tree.",
 "world_rm_girl_girl_1": "* There's a girl behind the tree.",
 "world_rm_girl_girl_2": "* She seems surprised to see you can find her.",
 "world_rm_girl_girl_3": "* She told you a pun about apples.",
 "world_rm_girl_girl_4": "* ...",
 "world_rm_girl_girl_5": "* But neither you nor she laughed.",
 "world_rm_girl_girl_6": "* She offers to give you something as compensation.",
 "world_rm_girl_girl_7": "* Accept her kindness?",
 "world_rm_girl_gotapple": "* You received the [color:yellow]Bad Apple[color:reset].",
 "world_rm_girl_whatgirl": "* What girl?",
 "world_rm_girl_nogirl": "* There's no girl.",

 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_1": "* Look over there!\n[wait:10][name:koakuma] is right there!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_2": "* Lady [name:scarlet],\n[wait:5]I have something important to report...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_3": "* What matter made you forget even the most basic manners,\n[wait:5]low-level demon?",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_4": "* I-I'm sorry,\n[wait:5]Lady [name:scarlet]!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_5": "* B-But, [wait:5]this is about the Lightners...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_6": "* Have you already dealt with those Lightners?",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_7": "* No...\n[wait:10]B-But Lady [name:patchouli] said...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_8": "* Oh... [wait:10]Low-level demon... [wait:10]Low-level demon... [wait:10]Low-level demon...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_9": "* Not only did you forget basic manners...\n[wait:10]you couldn't even complete your own task?",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_10": "* I... [wait:5]N-No, it's not like that...\n[wait:10]Lady [name:scarlet],\n[wait:5]please let me explain...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_11": "* A familiar like you has no reason to exist anymore.\n[wait:10]It would be better to have [name:patchouli] summon a new one.",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_12": "* N-No, don't!\n[wait:10]Lady [name:patchouli]! [wait:10][name:seija]!\n[wait:10]Anyone! [wait:10]Help me!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_13": "* How interesting.\n[wait:5]Jump up and bite your face?",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_14": "* Well... [wait:5]usually...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_15": "* It makes whoever holds it\nunable to suppress their desire to kill?",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_16": "* We... [wait:10]we did it!?",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_17": "* Wow!! [wait:5]I can't believe you guys actually\ndealt with her!!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_18": "* You guys are heroes!!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_19": "* We don't have to take a 20-minute detour\nback to the Scarlet Devil Mansion anymore!!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_20": "* Yeah, [wait:5]yeah, [wait:5]I know I did pretty well,\nright...?",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_21": "* ",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_22": "* ",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_23": "* ",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_24": "* ",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_25": "* Unfortunately, [wait:5]for you...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_26": "* ...I'm a demon!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_27": "* Huh?\n[wait:5]Are you serious?",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_28": "* That thing is just a\nbloodthirsty youkai!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_29": "* The kind you can't stop\nwithout giving her a good beating!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_30": "* Also, [wait:5]earlier,\n[wait:5]you scared those fairies...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_31": "* Those fairies are enemies!\n[wait:5]If fairies aren't scared,\nthey have no reason to exist!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_32": "* Yeah! [wait:5]She's right!!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_33": "* And before that, [wait:5]you ate an innocent passerby's\nMoonlight Grass Onigiri...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_34": "* Onigiri... [wait:10]are my enemies, too.",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_35": "* ...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_36": "* [name:seija]... [wait:10]whether you like it or not...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_37": "* You are a hero.",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_38": "* A hero capable of creating\na peaceful future.",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_39": "* Can you at least act... [wait:10]like a hero?",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_40": "* Wow, when you put it that way...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_41": "* I'm really a pretty pathetic hero,\n[wait:5]aren't I?",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_42": "* Alright, human.\n[wait:5]I get it.\n[wait:5]I'll change myself.",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_43": "* From now on, [wait:5]I'll be a hero\nlike a goody two-shoes...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_44": "* ...Just kidding!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_45": "* I'm an Amanojaku!\n[wait:5]Do you really think I'd change?",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_46": "* Then you're dead wrong!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_47": "* Since you want me to be a hero,\n[wait:5]I'll just be a villain instead!",
