 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_49": "* You want to team up with me?",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_50": "* Yeah, [wait:5]to be honest,\n[wait:5]this is exactly where I belong.",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_51": "* [name:seija], you...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_52": "* Shut up, creepy woman!\n[wait:5][name:seija] is my partner now!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_53": "* Hahaha, [wait:5]that's right, creepy woman!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_54": "* We'll wear ties\nembroidered with both of our names!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_55": "* Right!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_56": "* Then we'll stay over at each other's houses!\n[wait:5]And share secrets!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_57": "* Mm, [wait:5]right?",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_58": "* Anyway, [wait:5]uh, guys,\n[wait:5]see you never.",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_59": "* Haha!!\n[wait:5]But first, you guys have to actually live that long!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_60": "* [name:kogasa]...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_61": "* Maybe I shouldn't have been so strict\nwith her just now.",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_62": "* After all, she is an Amanojaku...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_63": "* But, [wait:5]I'm worried that if [name:seija] is too eager to fight...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_64": "* I'm afraid she might...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_65": "* Anyway, [wait:5]let's just be good to her, [wait:5]okay, [name:kogasa]?",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_66": "* I'm sure [name:seija] will be back very soon.",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_67": "* Not long ago, [wait:5]you approved my annual leave request...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_68": "* After I finish today's mansion cleaning duties...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_69": "* The acting chief maid I appointed\nwill handle the mansion's affairs in my place...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_70": "* And that acting chief maid...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_71": "* That's right! [wait:10]It's me!!!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_72": "* Now, [wait:5]I'm the chief maid!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_73": "* Curse you! [wait:10]You lowly rabble!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_74": "* I'll kill you!\n[wait:10]I'll kill all of you!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_75": "* Oh my, [wait:5]I think the young lady should\ngo back to her room and calm down...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_76": "* Everyone, [wait:5]could you do me a small favor?",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_77": "* As expected,\n[wait:5]humans are all useless!!!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_78": "* [name:kogasa], [wait:5]are you okay?",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_79": "* Don't worry, [wait:5]I'm fine.",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_80": "* Wow, [wait:5]you recovered so fast.\n[wait:10]It's a little... [wait:10]scary.",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_81": "* After all, [wait:5]you just got...\n[wait:10]pierced through... [wait:10]literally.",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_82": "* Thanks to [name:rin]'s healing magic!\n[wait:10]Thank you, [wait:5][name:rin]!",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_83": "* No... [wait:10]actually... [wait:10]if it weren't for me...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_84": "* I'm so foolish... [wait:10]really... [wait:10]to imagine I could be kind to\neveryone...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_85": "* In this world, [wait:5]you can't solve every conflict\nwith goodwill alone, [wait:5]right?",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_86": "* Uh, [wait:5]maybe.",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_87": "* But if you refuse to lower your guard,\n[wait:5]you might also hurt the people you want to protect.",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_88": "* So... [wait:10]being kind to others is also important...?",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_89": "* [name:seija]...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_90": "* Come on, [wait:5]I'm not a therapist...",
 "world_rm_manor_topbattle_cutscene_91": "* ... [name:kogasa], [wait:5]let's go.",

 "world_rm_manor_basement_cutscene_enter_1": "* We bring the key.",
 "world_rm_manor_basement_cutscene_enter_2": "* So?\n[wait:10]Are you coming out or what?",
 "world_rm_manor_basement_cutscene_enter_3": "* Out...?\n[wait:10]Aren't you misunderstanding something?",
 "world_rm_manor_basement_cutscene_enter_4": "* It's not about me going out.\n[wait:10]It's about you coming in.",
 "world_rm_manor_basement_cutscene_enter_5": "* Come in... [wait:10]and play a little game with me.",

 "world_rm_flandre_cutscene_1": "* [name:flandre],\n[wait:5]what game do you want to play with us?",
 "world_rm_flandre_cutscene_2": "* It seems you've misunderstood again.\n[wait:10]The one who needs you to play games with her isn't me...",
 "world_rm_flandre_cutscene_3": "* It's them!",
 "world_rm_flandre_cutscene_4": "* There are three more of you?!",
 "world_rm_flandre_cutscene_5": "* ...",
 "world_rm_flandre_cutscene_6": "* We're very busy people,\n[wait:5]with serious business to take care of.",
 "world_rm_flandre_cutscene_7": "* We don't have time to fool around with so many of you.",
 "world_rm_flandre_cutscene_8": "[noskip]* Come on, [wait:5]that's such a letdown!\n[wait:10]The game hasn't even started yet![wait:15]",
 "world_rm_flandre_cutscene_9": "[noskip]* Surrendering before the game even starts deserves a punishment![wait:15]",
 "world_rm_flandre_cutscene_10": "* And as punishment...",
 "world_rm_flandre_cutscene_11": "* I'll just crush that tsukumogami's eyes!",
 "world_rm_flandre_cutscene_tutorial": "(Hold [bind:confirm])",
 "world_rm_flandre_cutscene_12": "* [name:kogasa], [wait:5]are you okay?!",
 "world_rm_flandre_cutscene_13": "* I-[wait:3][face:bangs/sad]I'm fine,\n[wait:5]it's just...[wait:5]I feel a little strange...",
 "world_rm_flandre_cutscene_14": "* I don't know what exactly you did,\n[wait:5]but since you want to fight...",
 "world_rm_flandre_cutscene_15": "* Then bring it on!",

 "legend_dark_world_truth_1": "[name:seija], [wait:10]you know it.",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_2": "You and [name:kogasa] both live in the \"Light World.\"",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_3": "It's a place full of fantasy,\nyet strangely stable.",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_4": "That is...\n[wait:15]as long as there is light.",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_5": "And when darkness falls...",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_6": "Everything\nbecomes strange and unpredictable.",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_7": "An ordinary chair\nmight be mistaken for a youkai.",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_8": "A notice on the wall\nmight be mistaken for a ghost.",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_9": "Your perception is no longer clear.",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_10": "If the light disappears completely...",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_11": "You won't be able to perceive anything.",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_12": "Of course, [wait:10]you can't perceive\nwhat you can't sense.",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_13": "Then what if...",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_14": "What if it gets a little darker?",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_15": "Darker than darkness.",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_16": "If we could dispel that light\n[wait:10]which never existed in the first place...",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_17": "Until we reach\n[wait:10]that nonexistent far side?",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_18": "If that really happened...",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_19": "You would be able to perceive again.",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_20": "And hear again.",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_21": "And see again.",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_22": "This is the \"Dark World,\" [wait:5][name:seija].",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_23": "Another possibility of the reality you're in.",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_24": "In other words...",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_25": "... Everything is just an illusion.",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_26": "The Dark Fountain turns everything into\nthe way people imagine it.",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_27": "In the Light World, [wait:10]in reality...",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_28": "[name:koakuma] is just an ordinary familiar.\n[wait:10]She could never disobey any command from her master.",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_29": "[speed:0.35][name:yuyuko]...\n[wait:15]is an administrator of the Netherworld officially appointed by Hell.\n[wait:10]She could never be swayed by an animal spirit organization.",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_30": "That is to say...",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_31": "When light illuminates everything once more...",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_32": "That world\n[wait:10]will no longer be \"real.\"",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_33": "The places you've been,\n[wait:10]the people you've met...",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_34": "Will no longer be real either.",
 "legend_dark_world_truth_35": "Even I, standing before you now...\n[wait:15][speed:0.125]am actually not even...",

 "shop_meirin_encounter": "[emote:idle]* Welcome to Master [name:hong]'s Grocery.\n[wait:10]* How can I help you?",
 "shop_meirin_main": "[emote:idle]* Thanks for visiting my little old place.",
 "shop_meirin_leaving": "[emote:idle]* Come back any time!",

 "shop_meirin_buy_menu": "Just buy anything you want.",
 "shop_meirin_buy_confirmation": "Buy it for\n%s ?",
 "shop_meirin_buy_refuse": "Just buy anything you want.",
 "shop_meirin_buy": "Thank you for shopping!",
 "shop_meirin_buy_too_expensive": "Sorry, no discount.",
 "shop_meirin_buy_no_space": "You're\ncarrying\ntoo much.",

 "shop_meirin_sell_dialogue_1": "[emote:idle]* Huh?\n[wait:5]You have something to sell me?",
 "shop_meirin_sell_dialogue_2": "[emote:idle]* Sorry, but here's no scrapyard.\n[wait:10]* I'm trying to make a living by stuff-selling,\nnot junk-buying.",

 "shop_meirin_talk_menu": "Feel free to ask anything.",

 "shop_meirin_talk_about": "About yourself",
 "shop_meirin_about_1": "[emote:idle]* Me?[wait:5] My name's [name:hong_meirin],\n[wait:5]the gatekeeper at\nScarlet Devil Mansion.",
 "shop_meirin_about_2": "[emote:idle]* At least I was one.\n[wait:10]* Now I'm just a nameless youkai running a small shop.",

 "shop_meirin_talk_mansion": "Scarlet Devil Mansion",
 "shop_meirin_mansion_1": "[emote:idle]* The Scarlet Devil Mansion, the residence of Lady [name:remilia_scarlet].\n[wait:10]* It's also where I used to work.",
 "shop_meirin_mansion_2": "[emote:idle]* Now it has become a heavily fortified castle,\n[wait:5]whose danger level has gone up by about 70% higher than before.",
 "shop_meirin_mansion_3": "[emote:idle]* As the former gatekeeper,\n[wait:5]I feel deeply sorry about that.\n[wait:10]* After all, you'll never see those fairies playing at the Mansion's gate again.",

 "shop_meirin_talk_bandage": "Bandage on the head...",
 "shop_meirin_bandage_1": "[emote:idle]* Are you talking about the bandages wrapped around my head?\n[wait:10]* Those were pierced through by Ladyress [name:remilia_scarlet] herself.",
 "shop_meirin_bandage_2": "[emote:idle]* If I weren't so resilient, I'd have been dead for good.",
 "shop_meirin_bandage_3": "[emote:idle]* But even so, I won't hate Lady [name:remilia] anyway.",

 "shop_meirin_talk_why": "Why not hate her?",
 "shop_meirin_why_1": "[emote:idle]* To say there's none at all would be a lie. But I know Lady [name:remilia] wasn't always like that.\n[wait:10]* And this is certainly not her fault.",
 "shop_meirin_why_2": "[emote:idle]* A while ago, [wait:5]something unusual suddenly occurred inside the Mansion...\n[wait:10]* A dark fountain appeared.",
 "shop_meirin_why_3": "* Lady Patchouli was drawn to it and decided to keep it for study.",
 "shop_meirin_why_4": "* But as time went on, [wait:5]everyone in the Mansion started acting strangely.\n[wait:10]* Even I, who usually live outside, was somewhat affected.",
 "shop_meirin_why_5": "* Just as I was heading to the grand library to ask Lady Patchouli to stop her research and explain the effecMistLady [name:remilia] stopped me.",
 "shop_meirin_why_6": "* After an argument, [wait:5]she summoned Gungnir and pierced my head right through...\n[wait:10][emote:idle]* Sorry, I got a bit off track, didn't I?",
 "shop_meirin_why_7": "* Anyway, [wait:5]Lady [name:remilia] isn't bad by nature.\n[wait:10]* She only became this way because of the influence of that so-called dark fountain.",

 "shop_meirin_talk_legendary": "We're legendary",
 "shop_meirin_legendary_1": "[emote:idle]* So that rumor is true, huh?\n[wait:10]* You guys do seem to have some heroic streak.",
 "shop_meirin_legendary_2": "[emote:idle]* Sorry, but the only help I can offer is to sell you some stuff that could be useful.",
 "shop_meirin_legendary_3": "* And I can't give you a discount either.\n[wait:10]* I've got to make a living myself, you know?"
}